              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Simple and delicious for breakfast, just as the submitter states. I mixed in some fresh berries along with the frozen and used ground cinnamon plus a dash of nutmeg. I didn't have flax seed so I used wheat germ instead. I topped it off with some fat free vanilla yogurt - YUM!"
